WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
The table is alive. Chummer6 keeps the work in one place.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:14.000
NEXUS-PAN is continuity and recovery for devices at the table.

3
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:22.000
ALICE is a base workbench feature for build help and rules explanation.

4
00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:30.000
KARMA FORGE is the expansion bet for governed rule evolution.

5
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:38.000
JACKPOINT joins the campaign-memory lane.

6
00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:46.000
RUNSITE is a specialized play mode for readable mission spaces.

7
00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:54.000
RUNBOOK PRESS joins the publish/share lane.

8
00:00:54.000 --> 00:01:02.000
TABLE PULSE is campaign operations, not a random extra brand.

9
00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:12.000
BLACK LEDGER remains the big living-city expansion bet.

10
00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:20.000
COMMUNITY HUB joins the social and open-run lane.

11
00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:30.000
One product spine: build, explain, run, remember, publish.
